  m_text: 'Again, to who it may concern:

    The following hallway has sunken for
    no explainable reason. Please wall-run against the wall to get to the server
    room.


    P.S.

    Forget how to wall run? Simple, hold "A" or "D" while running
    against a white wall to run against it, and jump to jump of said wall.'
